# How to Use These Answers

## What is in this document
@py qa_index n

## How every answer is built
1. The question, exactly as set.
2. The answer map — the centre states what the question asks, limb by limb; every branch is a numbered heading.
3. Decoding the question — the command words and what each limb demands.
4. The model answer — definitions first; headings from the question's own words; evidence inside every heading; a diagram; the Pakistan angle; a balanced conclusion.
5. Why this answer scores.

